WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.580
Charlie is a church mouse.

2
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.280
It is time for lunch.

3
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.060
So Charlie looks for cheese.

4
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.320
He checks the chair.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.919
There is chocolate on the chair.

6
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:30.160
"No! Not chocolate. I want cheese."

7
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.930
He checks the chest.

8
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.750
There are cherries on the chest.

9
00:00:38.926 --> 00:00:45.012
"No! Not cherries. I want cheese."

10
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.620
He checks the couch.

11
00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:53.460
There is a chicken on the couch.

12
00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:59.410
"No! Not chicken. I want cheese."

13
00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.839
He checks the bench.

14
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.480
There is cheese on the bench!

15
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:12.325
"Yes! Cheese!"

16
00:01:12.326 --> 00:01:17.008
Cheese is a good lunch for a church mouse.

17
00:01:17.522 --> 00:01:44.623
2
